#: dragonpilot/selfdrive/ui/jetlink_ui.py
msgid "Run the large model on a device connected to comma USB-C (USB for Jetson / Linux PC / Mac; iOS for iPhone). Enabling disables ADB. Change modes only while offroad. If the link drops or lags, comma falls back to its small model."
msgstr "在连接至 comma USB-C 端口的外部设备（Jetson / Linux PC / Mac 使用 USB，iPhone 使用 iOS）上运行大模型。启用后会关闭 ADB，仅可在非行车状态切换。连接中断或延迟时，comma 会切回本机小模型。"

